@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title Ports & Adapters：核心不知道自己在哪裡執行
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 60
rectangle "C++ 核心（純邏輯，不做 I/O）" as core #DDEFD9 {
  [排程・領域・分析] as logic
  interface "ReviewRepository\n（port）" as P1
  interface "Clock\n（port）" as P2
  logic -down-> P1
  logic -down-> P2
}
together {
  [IndexedDB adapter\nTS，經 WASM] as A1
  [資料庫 adapter\nC++ server] as A2
  [記憶體假實作\n單元測試] as A3
}
together {
  [系統時鐘] as A5
  [固定時鐘\n單元測試] as A4
}
P1 <|.down. A1
P1 <|.down. A2
P1 <|.down. A3
P2 <|.down. A5
P2 <|.down. A4
note bottom of A3
  核心測試不需要瀏覽器或資料庫
end note
note bottom of A4
  時間由 port 注入 → 測試可重現
end note
@enduml
